{"id": 43793282, "slug": "big-infrastructure-ideas-for-monetary", "title": "Big infrastructure ideas for Monetary Policy 3 (MP3)", "subtitle": "August 2nd, 2019", "post_date": "2021-11-09T19:39:58.498Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 347, "reaction_count": 0, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 0}, "body_html": "<p>At some point, we in the US are going to need to print some money to stimulate the economy.</p><p>Has anyone seen any of those \u2018shovel ready\u2019 projects mentioned back in the 2008 stimulus package? Me either.</p><p>So, with the goal of being constructive (it\u2019s not all doom and gloom over here at BSC HQ) we\u2019re starting a new series, called Big Ideas for the NewNew Deal.</p><p>In short, if you had to print and spend $3tr, where should it go?</p><p>Some of these ideas may sound a little zany, some of them are definitely half-baked. But the goal is to open the aperture, and hopefully help spur a more productive conversation about where all that money should go, when we open the fire-hose.</p><p>With that in mind, here\u2019s Part 1: Transportation.</p><p>First step, let\u2019s make all that cheap land in the East Bay accessible, through a functional transit system. When I first moved to SF I was shocked at how disconnected SF was from Oakland, owing to the fact you have basically one bridge connecting the two major metropolitan areas.</p><p>This is stupid, let\u2019s fix it.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png\" width=\"548\" height=\"540\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/eae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:540,&quot;width&quot;:548,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;sf.bridges.PNG&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"sf.bridges.PNG\" title=\"sf.bridges.PNG\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!No6k!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feae651f7-81b9-4c8f-98ae-b72e29d8cce2_548x540.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" ta